% expect-output: 3
% expect-output: cexec
% divergence: cexec-defined
% Scenario: cexec. The job-server escape executes its operand as exec
% does, under its own name for error attribution.
% Expect: 3, cexec.
{ 1 2 add = } cexec
{ cexec } stopped pop $error /command get 16 string cvs =
